export anchor TestReading:
    spec:
        The .pi files under the source root, with the Piton fluency prompt
        `piton agent` gives the same tool.
    code:
        The code root, which is the codeRoot of the test settings when they give
        one, else Belay's codeRoot when the project configures Belay, and
        otherwise the project root. The project root, however it is chosen,
        leaves out the source root, tethers/, the build output, and generated
        agent directories.
    both: Both, and the statement has to hold in each.
